# Enigma Drake's power is set by a characteristic-defining ability (CR 604.3). Dress Down ("Creatures lose all abilities") removes
# it along with flying (CR 613.1f): with an instant in the graveyard the Drake would be 1/4, but without the ability its power is 0
# (CR 208.5) and its toughness stays the printed 4, and it is no longer flying. When Dress Down is sacrificed at the end step the
# Drake counts again: 1/4 flying (the Lotus and Dress Down in the graveyard are an artifact and an enchantment, not instants).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Black Lotus
Enigma Drake
Lightning Bolt
Dress Down
Island
Island
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Enigma Drake.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Enigma Drake.Power = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Enigma Drake.Toughness = 4
? Bot1.Battlefield.Enigma Drake.Keywords = Flying

[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Island#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Dress Down.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[T5 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Dress Down.Colors = Blue
? Bot1.Battlefield.Enigma Drake.Power = 0
? Bot1.Battlefield.Enigma Drake.Toughness = 4
? Bot1.Battlefield.Enigma Drake.Keywords = (absent)

[T7 Bot1.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Dress Down = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Enigma Drake.Power = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Enigma Drake.Toughness = 4
Bot1.Battlefield.Enigma Drake.Keywords = Flying
